---
// Chapter 8: Empty state showdown — raw unpopulated table with dead filter chrome
// vs first-class empty state (visual anchor, clear explanation, single primary CTA, dead chrome hidden).
// Plain inline SVG using site CSS tokens; no <defs> IDs needed.

const W = 900;
const H = 370;
---
<figure class="fes">
  <div class="fes-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: an empty table still showing search box, filter dropdowns, and column headers above a bare No records found message. Right: a designed empty state hiding unused filters, with a simple visual anchor, plain explanation, and one prominent primary button.">
      {/* Headers */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="fes-head is-muted">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Default empty table (dead chrome)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bảng trống mặc định (dư thanh lọc)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="470" y="26" class="fes-head is-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Designed empty state</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Màn hình trống có chủ đích</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left window */}
      <rect x="20" y="40" width="420" height="296" rx="10" class="fes-shell" />
      {/* Dead toolbar: search + filters + tabs */}
      <rect x="36" y="56" width="160" height="28" rx="5" class="fes-dead-input" />
      <text x="48" y="75" class="fes-dead-text">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Search webhooks...</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tìm webhook...</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="206" y="56" width="94" height="28" rx="5" class="fes-dead-input" />
      <text x="218" y="75" class="fes-dead-text">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Status: All</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trạng thái</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="310" y="56" width="114" height="28" rx="5" class="fes-dead-input" />
      <text x="322" y="75" class="fes-dead-text">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Export CSV</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xuất CSV</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Empty table header */}
      <rect x="36" y="98" width="388" height="28" rx="4" class="fes-thead" />
      <text x="48" y="117" class="fes-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Endpoint</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đường dẫn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="210" y="117" class="fes-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Events</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sự kiện</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="330" y="117" class="fes-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Last 24h</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>24 giờ qua</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bare empty body */}
      <rect x="36" y="126" width="388" height="170" rx="4" class="fes-tbody" />
      <text x="230" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="fes-empty-raw">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No records found.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không có dữ liệu.</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="20" y="358" class="fes-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Search, filters, and Export do nothing when count is zero.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô tìm kiếm, bộ lọc và nút Xuất đều vô nghĩa khi danh sách trống.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right window */}
      <rect x="470" y="40" width="410" height="296" rx="10" class="fes-shell is-polished" />

      {/* Simple editorial icon graphic */}
      <circle cx="675" cy="112" r="30" class="fes-visual-bg" />
      <rect x="661" y="99" width="28" height="22" rx="4" class="fes-visual-stroke" />
      <path d="M 667 110 L 672 115 L 683 105" class="fes-visual-stroke" />

      {/* Clear cause + value */}
      <text x="675" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="fes-empty-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No webhooks configured yet</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chưa có webhook nào được tạo</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="675" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="fes-empty-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Listen for payment and deploy events in real time.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhận thông báo sự kiện thanh toán và deploy ngay lập tức.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Primary CTA */}
      <rect x="590" y="218" width="170" height="38" rx="7" class="fes-cta" />
      <text x="675" y="242" text-anchor="middle" class="fes-cta-text">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Add first webhook</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tạo webhook đầu tiên</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Secondary link */}
      <text x="675" y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="fes-sec-link">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Read webhook payload guide</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xem tài liệu định dạng payload</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="470" y="358" class="fes-note is-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Filters stay hidden until the user creates their first item.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ẩn bộ lọc cho tới khi người dùng tạo mục đầu tiên.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>An empty state is often the very first screen a new user sees. Hide unused controls, explain what lives here, and give one obvious action to start.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Màn hình trống thường là thứ đầu tiên người dùng mới thấy. Hãy ẩn các nút lọc vô tác dụng, giải thích mục đích màn hình và đưa một nút hành động rõ ràng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fes { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fes-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .fes svg { width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }

  .fes-head { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .fes-head.is-muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fes-head.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }

  .fes-shell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .fes-shell.is-polished { stroke: var(--red); stroke-opacity: 0.45; }

  .fes-dead-input { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fes-dead-text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-faint); }

  .fes-thead { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fes-th { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fes-tbody { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fes-empty-raw { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-faint); }

  .fes-visual-bg { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .fes-visual-stroke { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  .fes-empty-title { font-size: 16.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .fes-empty-body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }

  .fes-cta { fill: var(--red); }
  .fes-cta-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: #ffffff; }
  .fes-sec-link { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: underline; }

  .fes-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fes-note.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }

  .fes figcaption { margin-top: 0.8em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
